special_abilities:
  - name: "Prehensile Tail"
    description: "A 12-foot prehensile tail that feels around narrow openings and small spaces, snatches small objects around corners, slashes, parries and entangles. It carries three pairs of vibro-blades that launch like mini-missiles and are steered by remote control: the smaller blades do 2D6 M.D. and the large one 3D6 M.D., each strike counts as one of the ''borg''s melee attacks, and the ''borg is -1 to strike for every blade in flight. Line of sight, 500 feet (152 m) at most; a blade not destroyed (15 M.D.C. small, 25 large) returns and reattaches. The fixed tip blade stabs for 1D6 M.D. and hooks on to help climbing. A blunt tail strike does 6D6 S.D.C., half when restrained. Reach 12 feet (3.6 m)."
  - name: "Concealed Mouth Particle Beam Gun"
    description: "Points, opens its mouth and fires: 1D4x10 M.D. per blast, anti-armor and anti-cyborg. Rate of fire equals the hand to hand attacks. Range 1200 feet (365 m). 24 blasts per hour, regenerating from the power supply."
  - name: "Grappling Spike (nose horn)"
    description: "The rhinoceros-like snout horn jabs, stabs and parries for 1D4 M.D., or its tip fires on a cable for climbing or snagging vehicles and bots. Range 200 feet (61 m), one shot; the spike is reeled back into its housing, or the line cut and the spike abandoned."
  - name: "Cheek Blades"
    description: "Blades on the head, used for parrying and slashing: 1D6 M.D."
  - name: "Four Arms"
    description: "Four identical arms, part of the combat bonuses, able to do delicate mechanical work such as bomb disposal and to use any human-sized pistol, rifle, rail gun, tool or equipment."
  - name: "Long Prehensile Neck"
    description: "A snaking six-foot neck lets the ''borg look over walls and around corners, high or at foot level, without showing its body, and push its head into small openings and air ducts. Two video cameras on each side of the neck and one in each knee record sound and picture."
  - name: "Folding Wings and Jet Thruster"
    description: "Bat-like folding wings (90 M.D.C. each) for gliding and control, +10% to the jet pack piloting skill while the wings are intact (the body''s, so it is not folded into the stored Jet Packs figure, which is the soldier''s +20%). Flight is by the removable back jet thruster only; a common ploy is to cut the thruster near a target and glide in silently. With one or both wings destroyed the ''borg can still fly on the jet pack, at -20% on piloting."
  - name: "Leaping Legs"
    description: "Legs built for leaping and a loping run: 120 mph (192 km) running, a 25-foot (7.6 m) leap high or lengthwise, and a running leap adds 1D4x10 yards/meters."
  - name: "Mega-Damage Hand to Hand"
    description: "Physical strength is S.D.C. based except for special attacks. Restrained punch 1D6+12 S.D.C., full strength punch 3D6+12 S.D.C., power punch 1D4 M.D. (two attacks), head butt 2D6 S.D.C., kick 4D6+12 S.D.C., jump kick or leap attack 2D4 M.D. (two attacks), judo-style throw or flip 3D6 S.D.C., full speed ram or body block 1D4 M.D. (two attacks). Equal to P.S. 24, P.P. 22, Spd 176 (stored as the body''s attributes); the +4 to strike, parry and dodge the book prints for P.P. 22 comes from the stored P.P."
